{title: 543 - Jesus, Friend of Little Children}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #543 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 543}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Jesus, Friend of little children,
Be a friend to me;
Take my hand and ever keep me
Close to Thee.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Teach me how to grow in goodness,
Daily as I grow;
Thou hast been a child, and surely
Thou dost know.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Step by step, O, lead me onward,
Upward into youth;
Wiser, stronger, still becoming
In Thy truth.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
Never leave me, nor forsake me;
Ever be my friend;
For I need Thee from life's dawning
To its end.
{end_of_verse}
